@startuml
title Event-Driven Architecture — Event Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Producer Service" as Producer
component "Event Publisher" as Publisher

queue "Kafka Topic" as Kafka

component "Consumer A" as ConsumerA
component "Consumer B" as ConsumerB

database "Consumer A State" as StateA
database "Consumer B State" as StateB

Producer --> Publisher : Create event
Publisher --> Kafka : Publish event

Kafka --> ConsumerA : Event
Kafka --> ConsumerB : Event

ConsumerA --> StateA : Process event
ConsumerB --> StateB : Process event

note right of Kafka
Partitioned event stream
At-least-once delivery
Ordering within partition
end note

@enduml
